  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a woman with a distressed expression, holding her head in her hands while looking at a laptop, with text overlay that reads 'there must be some way this victimizes me.' The scene conveys frustration or despair related to a situation perceived as unfairly targeting or harming her. The overall intent is to humorously or ironically express the feeling of being a victim of circumstances, often used to describe situations where someone feels unfairly targeted or overwhelmed by external forces. There is no toxicity present in the image; it does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements. The meme is self-referential and relatable, using the visual of distress to amplify the textual message about feeling victimized, without targeting any specific group or individual based on protected characteristics.",
